    "section": "Event Companion",
    "order": 12,
    "anchor": "achieving-secondary-missions",
    "summary": "As each player's turn ends, both players resolve these steps, the active player first:\n\n1. Score the VP of each Secondary Mission whose conditions you met, if you choose. With Tactical Secondary Missions, discard each one scored; it is achieved.\n2. Then, in your own turn and only with Tactical Secondary Missions, you may discard 1 or more active Secondary Missions; doing so gains 1 CP in total.",
